/ wait for %a%, %b% answers a list of their results, in the order named — not the order they ended.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Late", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%a%, Value=%!data%)
- goal.call(Name="Early", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%b%, Value=%!data%)
- task.wait(List=[%a%, %b%]); variable.set(Name=%results%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.equals(Expected="late", Actual=%results[0]%, Message="the first named is first")
- assert.equals(Expected="early", Actual=%results[1]%, Message="the second named is second")

Late
- timer.sleep(Duration="300ms")
- goal.return(Data="late")

Early
- goal.return(Data="early")
